Package: com.local.glassfolderstest3
Name: GlassFolders
Version: 0.7.4~beta1.8
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64e
Description: RootHide build that reuses SBHLibraryCategoryPodBackgroundView as an independent native App Library visual layer inside closed folders, then adds a stronger wallpaper-preserving CABackdrop body and brighter specular rails. The real App Library is not modified; the conservative opened-folder path is retained.
Maintainer: kulinich
Author: kulinich
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate, preferenceloader, firmware (>= 16.0)
